{
  "id": 45,
  "sort_order": 42,
  "name": "transmission",
  "category": "file",
  "description": "Transmission 是一款简单、轻量、跨平台的 BitTorrent 客户端，基于 linuxserver.io 镜像，提供 Web UI 管理下载。",
  "version": "latest",
  "logo": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/linuxserver/docker-transmission/master/logo/transmission.png",
  "website": "https://github.com/linuxserver/docker-transmission",
  "tutorial": "访问地址：http://服务器IP:9091\n默认 Web UI 无密码，可通过 USER/PASS 环境变量设置认证。\nPUID/PGID 设为拥有下载目录的宿主用户 ID。",
  "dotenv": "TRANSMISSION_PASS=\n",
  "compose": "services:\n  transmission:\n    image: lscr.io/linuxserver/transmission:latest\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      - \"9091:9091\"\n      - \"51413:51413\"\n      - \"51413:51413/udp\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./config:/config\n      - ./downloads:/downloads\n      - ./watch:/watch\n    environment:\n      - PUID=1000\n      - PGID=1000\n      - TZ=Asia/Shanghai\n      - USER=admin\n      - PASS=${TRANSMISSION_PASS}",
